7:[["$","$Lf",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"ref":"$undefined","className":"sm:px-8 mt-16 sm:mt-32","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"ref":"$undefined","className":"relative px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:max-w-5xl","children":[["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/en/projects","className":"text-sm font-medium text-orange-500 transition hover:text-orange-600 dark:hover:text-orange-400","children":"Back to projects"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem]","children":[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-orange-500","children":"Full-Stack & Systems Engineer"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Business Time & Expense Tracker Operations Platform"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Built a full-stack employee operations system for employees, managers, and admins to replace manual timesheet/expense workflows with secure submission, approvals, and reporting."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative mt-10 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/tes.png","alt":"Business Time & Expense Tracker Operations Platform","className":"h-full w-full object-cover"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 space-y-12","children":[["$","section","Problem",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Problem"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","Timesheet and expense workflows were manual, fragmented, and dependent on outdated tools, resulting in low visibility into submission status, approval progress, and reporting.",{"children":"Timesheet and expense workflows were manual, fragmented, and dependent on outdated tools, resulting in low visibility into submission status, approval progress, and reporting."}],["$","p","The existing system had significant security gaps and had previously experienced a breach, highlighting the need for a more secure and controlled architecture.",{"children":"The existing system had significant security gaps and had previously experienced a breach, highlighting the need for a more secure and controlled architecture."}],["$","p","There was no reliable mechanism for reminding employees to complete submissions, leading to delays and administrative overhead. Event management functionality was limited and difficult to use",{"children":"There was no reliable mechanism for reminding employees to complete submissions, leading to delays and administrative overhead. Event management functionality was limited and difficult to use"}],["$","p","Additionally, the system lacked mobile support and was restricted to legacy browser environments, preventing employees from submitting time and expenses efficiently, especially when uploading receipts or working remotely.",{"children":"Additionally, the system lacked mobile support and was restricted to legacy browser environments, preventing employees from submitting time and expenses efficiently, especially when uploading receipts or working remotely."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Role and ownership",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Role and ownership"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","Owned end-to-end development and operation of a production system across frontend, backend, database, and authentication/security.",{"children":"Owned end-to-end development and operation of a production system across frontend, backend, database, and authentication/security."}],["$","p","Implemented core workflows (timesheets, expenses, events, reporting, RBAC) and led architecture improvements to enhance maintainability and scalability.",{"children":"Implemented core workflows (timesheets, expenses, events, reporting, RBAC) and led architecture improvements to enhance maintainability and scalability."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Architecture and features",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Architecture and features"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","Frontend used React 18, Vite, React Router, Context API, and Tailwind. Backend used Node.js, Express, Sequelize, and MSSQL.",{"children":"Frontend used React 18, Vite, React Router, Context API, and Tailwind. Backend used Node.js, Express, Sequelize, and MSSQL."}],["$","p","Infrastructure was deployed on a Linux server using Docker containers, with Nginx as a reverse proxy and GitHub Actions runners enabling automated builds and updates.",{"children":"Infrastructure was deployed on a Linux server using Docker containers, with Nginx as a reverse proxy and GitHub Actions runners enabling automated builds and updates."}],["$","p","Security used JWT access and refresh cookies with session persistence, refresh rotation, and CSRF protection.",{"children":"Security used JWT access and refresh cookies with session persistence, refresh rotation, and CSRF protection."}],["$","p","Core functionality included secure authentication, timesheet and expense approval workflows, role-based access control (RBAC), event calendar management, and manager/admin reporting with automated reminders.",{"children":"Core functionality included secure authentication, timesheet and expense approval workflows, role-based access control (RBAC), event calendar management, and manager/admin reporting with automated reminders."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Challenges and solutions",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Challenges and solutions"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","Backend logic had become difficult to maintain due to tightly coupled controller code. Refactored toward a service-based structure (DTO/service/repository) to improve separation of concerns and scalability.",{"children":"Backend logic had become difficult to maintain due to tightly coupled controller code. Refactored toward a service-based structure (DTO/service/repository) to improve separation of concerns and scalability."}],["$","p","Managing secure session lifecycles across login, refresh, and logout introduced complexity. Implemented persistent sessions, refresh token rotation, and idle/absolute timeouts to ensure both security and reliability.",{"children":"Managing secure session lifecycles across login, refresh, and logout introduced complexity. Implemented persistent sessions, refresh token rotation, and idle/absolute timeouts to ensure both security and reliability."}],["$","p","Frontend API handling was inconsistent and duplicated across components. Introduced a centralized API client to standardize request handling, authentication flows, and error management.",{"children":"Frontend API handling was inconsistent and duplicated across components. Introduced a centralized API client to standardize request handling, authentication flows, and error management."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Impact and delivery",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100","children":"Impact and delivery"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400","children":[["$","p","Used by internal employees, managers, accounting, and admins, improving submission and approval efficiency while reducing manual follow-up work.",{"children":"Used by internal employees, managers, accounting, and admins, improving submission and approval efficiency while reducing manual follow-up work."}],["$","p","Centralized reporting for both employees and accounting, and introduced in-app and email reminders to ensure timely completion of timesheets and expense submissions.",{"children":"Centralized reporting for both employees and accounting, and introduced in-app and email reminders to ensure timely completion of timesheets and expense submissions."}],["$","p","Improved event management workflows, strengthened overall system security, and delivered a fully responsive interface enabling mobile access and receipt uploads, replacing a legacy, non-mobile-compatible system.",{"children":"Improved event management workflows, strengthened overall system security, and delivered a fully responsive interface enabling mobile access and receipt uploads, replacing a legacy, non-mobile-compatible system."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200/70 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-zinc-900/5 dark:border-zinc-700/60 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 dark:shadow-black/20","children":["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Role"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Full-Stack & Systems Engineer"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Timeline"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"June 2024 - April 2026 (internal production use)"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Stack"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","React 18 + Vite + Tailwind",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"React 18 + Vite + Tailwind"}],["$","span","Node.js + Express + Sequelize",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Node.js + Express + Sequelize"}],["$","span","Microsoft SQL Server",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Microsoft SQL Server"}],["$","span","JWT + refresh cookies + CSRF",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"JWT + refresh cookies + CSRF"}],["$","span","Linux + Nginx + Docker ",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"Linux + Nginx + Docker "}],["$","span","CI / CD with GitHub Actions",{"className":"rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300","children":"CI / CD with GitHub Actions"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400","children":"Links"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300","children":[["$","a","mailto:alexeygallegomartinez@gmail.com?subject=Business%20Time%20Expense%20Tracker%20walkthrough",{"href":"mailto:alexeygallegomartinez@gmail.com?subject=Business%20Time%20Expense%20Tracker%20walkthrough","className":"block font-medium text-orange-500 transition hover:text-orange-600 dark:hover:text-orange-400","children":"Request architecture walkthrough"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]]}]}]}]}]]
